{"title":"Embalmed Priest","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 49 Mummy that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (4.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: reviveHpFraction: .4</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/embalming-resin\">Embalming Resin</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>35</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>14</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>35</td><td>in the wilds around 2069, 907</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>50</b></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>14</td><td>in the wilds around 2079, 909</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"embalmed-priest\" data-map-level=\"50\">Show level 50 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 6 recorded drops, 198 total, 14–47 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"burial-wrappings\" title=\"Burial Wrappings - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8f1eee73d79eed6feb5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Burial Wrappings</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"funerary-amulet\" title=\"Funerary Amulet - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ec66ba5cfceb6dc5cfbe.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Funerary Amulet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"burial-wrappings\" title=\"Burial Wrappings - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 7 total, 7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8f1eee73d79eed6feb5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Burial Wrappings</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"shagbark-staff\" title=\"Shagbark Staff (staff-ice x1) - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ebc76f546f7e78794d2e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shagbark Staff</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Flawless: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sun King&#39;s Tomb</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 22</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-195\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2075, 903 <span class=\"muted\">· 19 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"embalmed-priest\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mummy: <a href=\"#/monster/withered-husk\">Withered Husk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(43)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mummy\">Mummy</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/93110eebbbe23ef1adb0.webp\" alt=\"Embalmed Priest\"></div><h3>Embalmed Priest</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 49)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Mummy</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>303</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>32</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>43 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}